# The `vscode` stub that lets the patcher be tested outside the editor. It lives in a
# node_modules folder because that is how `require("vscode")` finds it - but it is source,
# not a dependency, and without it the patcher has no test at all. That gap once shipped a
# build that could not even load.
!apps/vscode-claude/test/stub/node_modules/
!apps/vscode-claude/test/stub/node_modules/**
